('advanced-native-1602', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1602-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["讀書會的實際活動先出現，再影響桌子選擇。"],"options":["桌子選擇與任何生活用途無關，只按展示背景決定。","他們選桌子前已停止讀書會，選擇與目前活動沒有關係。","讀書會的實際活動先出現，再影響桌子選擇。","先有大桌子，之後才決定是否對閱讀有興趣。"]},"advanced-native-1602-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The meetings had already become part of our routine, so we needed space for them.","We based the choice on an activity we were actually doing.","The table responded to the group’s needs rather than creating our interest in meeting.","Furniture often follows life rather than leads it; the group showed us what we needed."],"options":["The meetings had already become part of our routine, so we needed space for them.","We based the choice on an activity we were actually doing.","The table responded to the group’s needs rather than creating our interest in meeting.","Furniture often follows life rather than leads it; the group showed us what we needed."]},"advanced-native-1602-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["In this case, furniture often follows life rather than leads it."],"options":["The friend chose the entire set before finding out which tools the work involved.","The choice deliberately ignores the drawing routine and focuses only on the advertisement.","In this case, furniture often follows life rather than leads it."]},"advanced-native-1602-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每個家庭在任何情況都不會因物品而調整活動。"],"options":["傢俬選擇可回應原已存在的生活活動。","每個家庭在任何情況都不會因物品而調整活動。","often 描述傾向，而不是沒有例外的規則。"]},"advanced-native-1602-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Furniture often follows life rather than leads it, so let us start with the activities your family actually shares."],"options":["Use only the advertised lifestyle as evidence of what the family already needs.","Furniture often follows life rather than leads it, so let us start with the activities your family actually shares.","Start with the display set and ask which family activities could be fitted around it."]},"advanced-native-1602-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["For our weekly mending sessions, furniture often follows life rather than leads it: we are looking for a practical surface because the shared activity already matters to us.","Our exchange request starts with the way we mend clothes together; furniture often follows life rather than leads it, so a matching display set is not our priority."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1603', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1603-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["判斷根據是尺寸及可用空間。"],"options":["他們只知道另一家買過相同桌子，沒有查看自己的房間。","判斷根據是尺寸及可用空間。","判斷只來自喜歡桌子的顏色，沒有看尺寸。","句子已說明桌子報價低於預算，但沒有談可用空間。"]},"advanced-native-1603-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We checked the measurements and found that it fits the flat.","We measured the room and allowed space to move around it.","We compared its size with the area where we planned to put it.","We made sure its dimensions worked with the room’s practical layout."],"options":["We checked the measurements and found that it fits the flat.","We measured the room and allowed space to move around it.","We compared its size with the area where we planned to put it.","We made sure its dimensions worked with the room’s practical layout."]},"advanced-native-1603-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["With those measurements checked, the cabinet fits the flat."],"options":["The colour match alone shows there is enough room beside the cabinet.","Because it worked in the showroom, we can leave our own measurements out.","With those measurements checked, the cabinet fits the flat."]},"advanced-native-1603-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["朋友說很喜歡它的顏色，但沒有尺寸資料。"],"options":["朋友說很喜歡它的顏色，但沒有尺寸資料。","放入後是否仍留有日常活動空間。","物品寬深及可擺放位置的尺寸。"]},"advanced-native-1603-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Let us check whether it fits the flat; the showroom’s appearance does not tell us our available space."],"options":["Since we like its shape, the remaining walking space is not relevant to the choice.","Let us check whether it fits the flat; the showroom’s appearance does not tell us our available space.","Use the showroom photograph as the only measurement of our corner."]},"advanced-native-1603-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Thank you for offering the table. Could you send its measurements so I can check whether it fits the flat without blocking our usual route?","I would like to borrow it for the family meal if it fit