('advanced-native-1605', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1605-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["日常使用經驗讓她的意見在佈局決定中較有分量。"],"options":["她只是聲量最大，所以句子沒有談意見的影響。","小組沒有聽過她的使用經驗，也沒有讓她參與。","她的影響只在會議主持次序，不涉及實際佈局選擇。","日常使用經驗讓她的意見在佈局決定中較有分量。"]},"advanced-native-1605-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She knew how the space was actually used, not just how it looked.","The group gave particular weight to the needs she could explain from experience.","She had the strongest voice because she understood the room’s practical demands.","Her daily experience showed which arrangements would help the work."],"options":["She knew how the space was actually used, not just how it looked.","The group gave particular weight to the needs she could explain from experience.","She had the strongest voice because she understood the room’s practical demands.","Her daily experience showed which arrangements would help the work."]},"advanced-native-1605-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The young users have the strongest voice in shaping the timetable, while staff explain the practical limits."],"options":["The strongest voice is simply the speaker whose microphone is turned up highest.","The users have no influence because staff also contribute information.","The young users have the strongest voice in shaping the timetable, while staff explain the practical limits."]},"advanced-native-1605-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["必須是說話最響，也可以省去聽其他意見。"],"options":["可以因實際使用經驗而有較大分量。","在某個決定中意見有最大影響。","必須是說話最響，也可以省去聽其他意見。"]},"advanced-native-1605-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The strongest voice here means the greatest influence; her detailed experience can carry weight even when she speaks quietly."],"options":["Rank the opinions only by microphone volume before considering their evidence.","If she does not speak loudly, leave her written comments out of the decision.","The strongest voice here means the greatest influence; her detailed experience can carry weight even when she speaks quietly."]},"advanced-native-1605-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The regular users should have the strongest voice in shaping the study-room rules, including those who prefer to submit written comments.","We can give the users the strongest voice by taking their written accounts seriously, while asking staff to explain the practical limits."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1606', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1606-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["她對單位及日常用品安排有深入了解。"],"options":["她剛第一次進去，尚未了解用品放哪裏。","她的熟悉只來自門外照片，沒有接觸單位日常。","她對單位及日常用品安排有深入了解。","她很會整理自己的用品，但不熟悉室友共用的收納。"]},"advanced-native-1606-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She has detailed experience of the everyday arrangements.","She can explain the storage system from long use.","She is familiar with the cupboards and the supplies people use each day.","She knows the flat inside out after organising it for years."],"options":["She has detailed experience of the everyday arrangements.","She can explain the storage system from long use.","She is familiar with the cupboards and the supplies people use each day.","She knows the flat inside out after organising it for years."]},"advanced-native-1606-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She knows the play inside out, though the new changes still need checking."],"options":["She knows the play inside out, though the new changes still need checking.","Knowing the earlier version means she already knows every detail of the unseen revision.","She has no familiarity with the play because one part has been revised."]},"advanced-native-1606-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["不用看剛推出的新改動，也必定知道新版本所有細節。"],"options":["對既有流程有深入了解。","不用看剛推出的新改動，也必定知道新版本所有細節。","可以用具體經驗向新人解釋日常步驟。"]},"advanced-native-1606-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I know the old process inside out, but I should review the revised steps before explaining the new version."],"options":["Since there is a revision, treat my earlier practical experience as having no value.","I know the old process inside out, but I should review the revised steps before explaining the new version.","Use my familiarity with the old process instead of opening the revision notes."]},"advanced-native-1606-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Lina knows the old town inside out, so I would ask her to guide our photography walk. Let’s send her our questions about the lanes an