('advanced-native-1609', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1609-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["摺架的固定用途及可收起特點，證明它值得保留。"],"options":["它只因價格高而值得保留，沒有談用途。","它已長期無人使用，也不能配合房間用途。","摺架的價值只在升值轉售，而不是目前的實際用途。","摺架的固定用途及可收起特點，證明它值得保留。"]},"advanced-native-1609-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Its practical role matches the way we use the room.","We can explain its value through tasks it regularly helps us do.","It earns its keep by storing our weekly materials and folding away when needed.","It provides useful storage without permanently taking all the floor space."],"options":["Its practical role matches the way we use the room.","We can explain its value through tasks it regularly helps us do.","It earns its keep by storing our weekly materials and folding away when needed.","It provides useful storage without permanently taking all the floor space."]},"advanced-native-1609-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The shared camera earns its keep through regular useful work."],"options":["Only a camera kept by one full-time user can justify its place, not one shared between groups.","The camera’s high price is the only evidence needed, even if nobody uses it.","The shared camera earns its keep through regular useful work."]},"advanced-native-1609-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只說它買入價很高，卻沒有用途或需要的例子。"],"options":["可解釋它為有限空間保留了甚麼實用功能。","能指出物品經常協助的實際工作。","只說它買入價很高，卻沒有用途或需要的例子。"]},"advanced-native-1609-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may still earn its keep if it reliably supports an important recurring task; let us look at the use we actually make of it."],"options":["Keep it only because of the original price, without asking what task it supports.","It may still earn its keep if it reliably supports an important recurring task; let us look at the use we actually make of it.","Count only whether it was used today and leave its other regular uses out."]},"advanced-native-1609-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Each example must earn its keep by helping a newcomer complete a real step. The paragraph that only repeats the heading needs a clearer purpose or should be shortened.","In this short guide, every section should earn its keep; I would keep the useful instructions and revise the decorative repetition."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1610', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1610-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["同一長凳有坐下及儲物兩種用途。"],"options":["長凳只是同一用途用了兩次，沒有第二功能。","兩種用途必須在同一秒發生，否則不算。","句子說有人把值班工時加倍，而不是描述物件用途。","同一長凳有坐下及儲物兩種用途。"]},"advanced-native-1610-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["One item provides two practical functions.","It combines somewhere to rest with a place to store things.","It does double duty as seating and storage.","Visitors can sit on it, and we can keep spare bags underneath."],"options":["One item provides two practical functions.","It combines somewhere to rest with a place to store things.","It does double duty as seating and storage.","Visitors can sit on it, and we can keep spare bags underneath."]},"advanced-native-1610-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The leaflet does double duty as a map and a programme."],"options":["The leaflet counts as two functions only because one person reads the same map twice.","The programme has replaced the map, so there is no route information left.","The leaflet does double duty as a map and a programme."]},"advanced-native-1610-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["同一椅子先後只供兩人坐，沒有其他用途。"],"options":["一個房間白天做工作室，晚上供客人休息。","同一椅子先後只供兩人坐，沒有其他用途。","活動名牌既顯示參加者姓名，也用作領餐券。"]},"advanced-native-1610-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Yes, it can do double duty by serving those two purposes at different times."],"options":["Yes, it can do double duty by serving those two purposes at different times.","Count only the daytime use because the two activities do not happen together.","Call it double duty only when the same working task is repeated twice."]},"advanced-native-1610-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The interviews can do double duty as local-history records and listening practice, provided we organise the material for both purposes.","Our recordings will do double duty: they preserve residents’ stories and give the language group material for close listening."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb)
